            "text": "\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<!--\n\n    CultureSuite is a product-led company\n    building the leading digital platform for the arts,\n    culture and entertainment sectors.\n    Our product powers websites and digital experiences\n    for cultural organisations around the world.\n\n    Join us!\n\n    https://www.culturesuite.co/about\n\n    -->\n\n<html\n    dir=\"ltr\"\n    lang=\"en\"\n    data-theme=\"system\"\n         xmlns:og=\"http://ogp.me/ns#\"    >\n\n    <head>\n        <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"The Shoshani Riddle is a captivating documentary that traces director Michael Grynszpan’s obsessive search for the truth behind one of the 20th century’s most enigmatic figures. \">\n\n                <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\n                    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.jw3.org.uk/whats-on/the-shoshani-riddle-xh56\">\n                    <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://img.jw3.org.uk/Uh764IsSRjSiS6FEz5KVwupdcvg1mB05P5zzeOWDf4I/c:1920:1008:fp:0.5:0.33/s:1200:630:1/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuanczLm9yZy51ay8vY21zX2ZpbGVzL3N5c3RlbS9pbWFnZXMvaW1nMTM0MF9vcmlnLmpwZw\">\n                    <meta property=\"og:image:secure_url\" content=\"https://img.jw3.org.uk/Uh764IsSRjSiS6FEz5KVwupdcvg1mB05P5zzeOWDf4I/c:1920:1008:fp:0.5:0.33/s:1200:630:1/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuanczLm9yZy51ay8vY21zX2ZpbGVzL3N5c3RlbS9pbWFnZXMvaW1nMTM0MF9vcmlnLmpwZw\">\n                    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\">\n                    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\">\n                    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"The Shoshani Riddle — PG\">\n                    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"The Shoshani Riddle is a captivating documentary that traces director Michael Grynszpan’s obsessive search for the truth behind one of the 20th century’s most enigmatic fi