 </li>\n    \n        \n                    </ul>\n\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_2\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n        <div  class=\"container-fluid teaserWrapper variant- align-\" style=\"padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 60px; background: var(--background2);\n\">\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                    <div class=\"richtext\">\n            <p><em>The Shoshani Riddle</em> is a captivating documentary that traces director Michael Grynszpan&rsquo;s obsessive search for the truth behind one of the 20th century&rsquo;s most enigmatic figures.&nbsp;</p>\n        </div>\n    \n        </div>\n\n        \n\n    </div>\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_3\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n        <div  class=\"container-fluid videoWrapper variant- align-\" style=\"padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: var(--background);\n\">\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                                \n    <aside  class=\"cookie-consent-banner cookie-consent-banner--placeholder\" data-controller=\"cookie-consent-form\">\n        <div class=\"cookie-consent-form\" data-cookie-domain=\"jw3.org.uk\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"inner\">\n                    <form name=\"cookieConsentOptions\">\n                        <div class=\"spinner-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"spinner\">\n\t<div class=\"rect1\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect2\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect3\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect4\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect5\"></div>\n</div>\n\n                        </div>\n                        <h2>Cookies</h2>\n\n                        <div class=\"cookie-consent-form__content\">\n                            <p>\n                                                                    We use services such as Youtube and Vimeo for videos and other media. To view this, you have to give permission to place cookies.\n                                \n                                                                    <button\n                                        class=\"cookie-consent-form__show-more\"\n                                        data-action=\"cookie-consent-form#showMore\"\n                                    >\n                                        More information&hellip;\n                                    </button>\n                                                            </p>\n                                                            <div class=\"cookie-consent-form__more-content\" id=\"more-page_part_3\">\n                                    <h3>Functional cookies</h3> <p>These are necessary for the website to function properly. This way your basket will be remembered and you can log in on the website with your account.</p> <h3>Minimal cookies</h3> <p>This option allows cookies to enrich your experience on the website. For example, media from third parties such as videos. We also keep statistics to continuously improve the site.</p> <h3>All cookies</h3> <p>With these cookies we collect further information to carry out our marketing activities, such as newsletters and advertisements, in the most efficient and personal way.</p>\n                                </div>\n                                                    </div>\n                        <fieldset class=\"cookie-consent-form__actions\">\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>\n                                    <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"default\" class=\"btn btn-reject\">\n                                        Only functional cookies\n                                    </button>\n                                </li>\n                                <li>\n                                    <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"limited\" class=\"btn btn-accept-limited\">\n                                        Minimal cookies\n                                    </button>\n                                </li>\n                                <li>\n                                    <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"all\" class=\"btn btn-accept-all\">\n                                        All cookies\n                                    </button>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </fieldset>\n                    </form>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n\n\n            \n        </div>\n\n        \n\n    </div>\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_4\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n                                            \n                        \n\n    \n<div class=\"container-fluid desc1Wrapper align- has-meta-info \" style=\"padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: var(--background);\n\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n                    <div class=\"desc1\">\n                <div class=\"richtext\"><p>He was one of the greatest geniuses that ever lived; a teacher, a scholar, a mathematician &ndash; he had a brilliant mind&hellip; and yet he slept on a park bench, had no real home and travelled the world. No one knows his real name; he is only known as Mr. Shoshani. He was an eternal nomad, a mad genius, who attracted disciples such as Nobel Prize winner Elie Wiesel and renowned philosopher Emmanuel Levinas.</p>\r\n<p>He was fluent in 30 languages, knew philosophy, physics, economics, biology, Kabbalah and other disciplines. With no family or friends, wandering homeless in shabby clothes, taking on multiple names and identities, he acquired a mythological status &ndash; some claim he was merely a legendary figure. How did he acquire his extensive knowledge? What was his world view? What was his secret?</p>\r\n<p>Mr. Shoshani is one of the unsolved riddles of the twentieth century and one of the ten most mysterious men ever. This is his story.</p></div>\n            </div>\n        \n                    <div class=\"metaWrapper\">\n                <div class=\"inner\">\n                                                                                                                                                <img class=\"poster\" src=\"https://img.jw3.org.uk/Ct7dJUAL-jH-amlvspmd9OjynuNyA0IPs_2an8BiSTg/rs:fit:1920:800:1/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuanczLm9yZy51ay8vY21zX2ZpbGVzL3N5c3RlbS9pbWFnZXMvaW1nMTM0MV9vcmlnLmpwZw\" alt=\"The Shoshani Riddle\">\n                    \n                                            <div class=\"infoList\">\n                            <dl>\n                                                                    <dt>Direction</dt>\n                                    <dd>Michael Grynszpan</dd>\n                                                                                                    <dt>Cast</dt>\n                                    <dd>Michael GrynszpanSerge KlarsfeldAdin Steinsaltz</dd>\n                                                                                                    <dt>Duration</dt>\n                                    <dd>88 min</dd>\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                            </dl>\n\n                            \n                        </div>\n                    \n                    \n                                            <div class=\"extraInfo\">\n                            <p>£9 / £15</p>\n                        </div>\n                    \n                                        \n\n                                        \n\n                                                        </div>\n            </div>\n            </div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\