2,56 56,56c30.928,0 56,-25.072 56,-56c0,-22.172 -12.888,-41.332 -31.579,-50.405l5.517,-24.276c3.413,-15.018 -8.002,-29.319 -23.403,-29.319l-268.418,0l-6.545,-32l293.145,0c11.206,0 20.92,-7.754 23.403,-18.681Z'/></g></svg></span>\n                    <span class='label'><span class='label'><span class=\"movie-time-start\">11:00 AM</span><span class='screenreader'>Tickets</span></span></span>\n                </a>\n\n            </div>\n</li>\n\n        \n        \n                                <li class=\"subshow type-info cost-message\">\n            <p>A booking fee of £2 and a security levy of £1.50 will be added to all orders. </p>\n        </li>\n    \n        \n                    </ul>\n\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        \n    </div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_2\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n        <div  class=\"container-fluid teaserWrapper variant- align-\" style=\"padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 60px; background: var(--background2);\n\">\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                    <div class=\"richtext\">\n            <p>Two films marking the third anniversary of October 7.</p>\n        </div>\n    \n        </div>\n\n        \n\n    </div>\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_3\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n        <div  class=\"container-fluid videoWrapper variant- align-\" style=\"padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: var(--background);\n\">\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"container\">\n                                \n    <aside  class=\"cookie-consent-banner cookie-consent-banner--placeholder\" data-controller=\"cookie-consent-form\">\n        <div class=\"cookie-consent-form\" data-cookie-domain=\"jw3.org.uk\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"inner\">\n                    <form name=\"cookieConsentOptions\">\n                        <div class=\"spinner-wrapper\">\n                            <div class=\"spinner\">\n\t<div class=\"rect1\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect2\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect3\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect4\"></div>\n\t<div class=\"rect5\"></div>\n</div>\n\n                        </div>\n                        <h2>Cookies</h2>\n\n                        <div class=\"cookie-consent-form__content\">\n                            <p>\n                                                                    We use services such as Youtube and Vimeo for videos and other media. To view this, you have to give permission to place cookies.\n                                \n                                                                    <button\n                                        class=\"cookie-consent-form__show-more\"\n                                        data-action=\"cookie-consent-form#showMore\"\n                                    >\n                                        More information&hellip;\n                                    </button>\n                                                            </p>\n                                                            <div class=\"cookie-consent-form__more-content\" id=\"more-page_part_3\">\n                                    <h3>Functional cookies</h3> <p>These are necessary for the website to function properly. This way your basket will be remembered and you can log in on the website with your account.</p> <h3>Minimal cookies</h3> <p>This option allows cookies to enrich your experience on the website. For example, media from third parties such as videos. We also keep statistics to continuously improve the site.</p> <h3>All cookies</h3> <p>With these cookies we collect further information to carry out our marketing activities, such as newsletters and advertisements, in the most efficient and personal way.</p>\n                                </div>\n                                                    </div>\n                        <fieldset class=\"cookie-consent-form__actions\">\n                            <ul>\n                                <li>\n                                    <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"default\" class=\"btn btn-reject\">\n                                        Only functional cookies\n                                    </button>\n                                </li>\n                                <li>\n                                    <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"limited\" class=\"btn btn-accept-limited\">\n                                        Minimal cookies\n                                    </button>\n                                </li>\n                                <li>\n                                    <button type=\"button\" name=\"cookieConsentLevel\" value=\"all\" class=\"btn btn-accept-all\">\n                                        All cookies\n                                    </button>\n                                </li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </fieldset>\n                    </form>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n\n\n            \n        </div>\n\n        \n\n    </div>\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_4\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n                                            \n                        \n\n    \n<div class=\"container-fluid desc1Wrapper align- has-meta-info \" style=\"padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: var(--background);\n\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n                    <div class=\"desc1\">\n                <div class=\"richtext\"><p><strong>Yellow Ribbons</strong></p><p>By putting up yellow ribbons around the city, Jewish Londoners show their unwavering support for the return of the hostages so cruelly taken on October 7th.</p><p><strong>The Bridge</strong></p><p>The Bridge follows these ten young Israeli survivors of the October 7th attacks as they travel from Israel to Los Angeles to attend the legendary Rock ‘n’ Roll Fantasy Camp. Bearing the weight of unimaginable trauma, they find healing and resilience through music, mentored by icons from bands like Guns N’ Roses, Van Halen, and Black Sabbath. What begins as a leap into the unknown becomes a once-in-a-lifetime journey where music is more than sound – it’s salvation.</p></div>\n            </div>\n        \n                    <div class=\"metaWrapper\">\n                <div class=\"inner\">\n                                                                                                                                                <img class=\"poster\" src=\"https://img.jw3.org.uk/fU_NSVloscHN4950krBaRgaCRexrP_4nUER1v0ifpNw/rs:fit:1920:800:1/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuanczLm9yZy51ay8vY21zX2ZpbGVzL3N5c3RlbS9pbWFnZXMvaW1nMTQ1MV9vcmlnLmpwZw\" alt=\"OCT 7TH FILMS: Yellow Ribbons + The Bridge\">\n                    \n                                            <div class=\"infoList\">\n                            <dl>\n                                                                    <dt>Direction</dt>\n                                    <dd>Michal McEwen (Yellow Ribbons); Brad Allgood (The Bridge)</dd>\n                                                                                                    <dt>Cast</dt>\n                                    <dd>Raz Shifer, Dov Engel, Ben King</dd>\n                                                                                                    <dt>Duration</dt>\n                                    <dd>80 min</dd>\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                            </dl>\n\n                            \n                        </div>\n                    \n                    \n                                            <div class=\"extraInfo\">\n                            <p>£9 / £15</p>\n                        </div>\n                    \n                                        \n\n                                        \n\n                                                        </div>\n            </div>\n            </div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_161\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_7\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_5\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t    \n\n\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_90\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_9\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_226\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_227\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_10\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_8\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_223\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t    \n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_114\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"page_part_11\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n    \n\n    <aside class=\"section section--suggestions container-fluid suggestionWrapper  variant-boxed arrows\" style=\"padding-top: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; background: var(--background);\n\">\n        <div id=\"suggestionHeader\" class=\"section__header\">\n            <h2 class=\"section__title\">Others also viewed</h2>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"inner section__inner\">\n\n            <div  class=\"carousel carousel--suggestions\" data-part-id=\"page_part_11\" data-carousel-id-value=\"page_part_11\" data-carousel-centered-value=\"false\" data-carousel-number-visible-value=\"1\" data-carousel-round-arrows-value=\"true\" data-carousel-loop-value=\"false\" data-carousel-auto-play-value=\"false\" data-carousel-auto-play-delay-value=\"0\" data-carousel-showcase-video-outlet=\"#page_part_11 [data-con